    thinking: "**Defining App Components**\n\nI\'m currently focused on structuring the application using modular components. I\'ve begun defining crucial data types in `src/types.ts`, encompassing messages, benchmark results, and service-related objects. Simultaneously, I\'m constructing the header component (`src/components/Header.tsx`) with branding and navigation elements.\n\n\n**Designing Hero Component**\n\nI\'ve just finalized the Hero component (`src/components/Hero.tsx`), giving it an \"Engineered for Performance\" badge and a headline. I\'ve included a subtitle specifically targeting the local market, and added \"Get a Quote\" and WhatsApp buttons. A live browser preview with performance stats (100/100, LCP 0.38s, zero vulnerabilities) is integrated.\n\n\n**Outlining Feature Roadmap**\n\nMy focus has shifted to crafting a detailed feature roadmap within the `ProcessTimeline.tsx` file, specifically outlining a 4-step engineering plan. I\'m also building an About Section, `src/components/AboutSection.tsx`, emphasizing operational discipline, a quarter-century of logistics experience, and core principles like zero missed deadlines. Next, I am creating a Quote Form component for interactive price and timeline estimation.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 2
      nanos: 672542225
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
