  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Verifying Requirements Compliance**\n\nI\'ve just finished a meticulous review. I\'ve successfully updated the `metadata.json` file. The `name` field now reads \"Dean Wilshaw Web Development\" and the `description` has been updated to reflect high-performance website builds.\n\n\n**Developing Local Business Solutions**\n\nI\'m now integrating AI-powered local business features. I\'ve configured an Express server with API endpoints for the Gemini AI assistant, quote generation, and speed benchmarking. Also, I have a modern UI with a high-performance light theme and a `<DW>` brand mark, a hero section, and a bento grid for the services provided.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built the web application for **Dean Wilshaw Web Development**, matching the design, branding, and performance requirements:\n\n### Key Features & Design Highlights\n\n- **Header & Brand Identity**:\n  - Distinctive `<DW>` brand mark icon paired with Dean Wilshaw\'s avatar and navigation links (*Services*, *Speed Audit*, *Why Custom*, *About*, *Process*).\n  - Direct CTA buttons for **Get a Quote** and **WhatsApp**.\n\n- **Hero & Interactive Browser Audit**:\n  - **Engineered for Performance** badge, high-impact headline, and lead generation value proposition tailored for Cheshire & Stoke-on-Trent local businesses.\n  - Interactive right-hand browser frame with **Live Preview**, **React Source Code**, and **Core Web Vitals Audit** tabs showcasing sub-0.5s LCP speeds and 100/100 Lighthouse performance.\n\n- **Engineered Solutions Bento Grid**:\n  - Four core service cards: *Custom React Builds*, *Lead-Gen Focused*, *Modern Technical SEO*, and *Operational Integrations*.\n  - Clickable cards that launch a detail modal with full features, tech stack, and conversion ROI impacts.\n\n- **Interactive Speed & Core Web Vitals Audit Simulator**:\n  - Allows visitors to enter their domain or pick a local industry (*Plumbing & Heating*, *Legal*, *Dental*, *Trades*) to benchmark standard WordPress templates against Dean\'s Custom React engine across load time, page weight, Lighthouse score, and security vulnerabilities.\n\n- **Why Custom Beats Templates Matrix**:\n  - Side-by-side comparison matrix breaking down speed, security, design, ongoing maintenance, Google SEO, and conversion rates.\n\n- **Built on Operational Discipline (About Section)**:\n  - Highlights Dean\'s 25 years of logistics operational leadership and commitment to zero missed deadlines, transparent communication, and ROI.\n\n- **4-Step Engineering Roadmap**:\n  - Clear timeline from Discovery to UX, React Build, and SEO Launch.\n\n- **Interactive Quote Calculator & Inquiry Form**:\n  - Live cost and turnaround estimator (`\302\243850\342\200\223\302\2431,500` for starter sites, `\302\2431,800\342\200\223\302\2433,200` for full business sites) with backend submission (`/api/quote`) producing reference numbers (e.g. `#DW-84920`).\n\n- **Stitch Support AI Assistant Widget**:\n  - Floating chatbot connected to a server-side Gemini AI route (`/api/chat`) using `@google/genai` to answer client questions about pricing, speed, and local coverage in real time."
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 508764893
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
